WEBVTT

00:08:27.795 --> 00:08:33.634
an absolutely unprecedented access
to Lando, the sports person.

00:08:33.676 --> 00:08:35.636
Something you don't normally get.

00:08:37.221 --> 00:08:39.598
Over lockdown, there was no sport.

00:08:40.766 --> 00:08:43.811
Journalists started writing
about esports.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:49.024
Mainstream broadcasters started
broadcasting esports on primary channels.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:52.570
We started looking at esports
in the millions.

00:08:52.987 --> 00:08:54.363
It was sport.

00:08:55.114 --> 00:08:57.074
It was the only sport.

00:08:58.075 --> 00:08:59.243
People under 20

00:08:59.243 --> 00:09:03.289
are much more likely to start
to watch esports or watch esports,